  "description": "While I was lying in a coma from a hit-and-run, my boyfriend and best friend betrayed me. The worst part? The driver who killed my father was her father. Driven by rage, I make a deal with the devil: use a powerful man madly in love with me to burn their lives to the ground. But I never expected he would be the one to completely consume me. A fiery tale of a woman obsessed with revenge—and the man obsessed with her.\n\n[Original Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=13107192) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=855152), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14757261)",
